  "scope": [
    "Separate library-test-only buffered raw-pool constructor, bounded application blocks, generation-owned terminal propagation and first-frame downstream submission staging.",
    "Successful upstream headers remain status 200 even if a body error is observed before response attachment; first-cause failure and Delivery::Flushed are serialized by the same request owner.",
    "The producer owns Incoming; the consumer owns the exact pool reservation. Producer EOF and encoder/body handoff do not grant delivery or continuity authority.",
    "No CompletionRegistry internals, vendor, Cargo or shipping TLS constructor changed for this experiment. Parent module registration, raw acquisition factoring and opt-in cfg(test) server hooks are included.",
    "Only synthetic numeric-loopback HTTP/TLS peers and synthetic credentials were used. No provider calls or production transport qualification."
  ],
